mission "The Monk Who Burned His Maps"
    name "The Monk Who Burned His Maps"
    description "Find Brother Mateo, who has been hiding a forbidden chart from a royal collector."
    source "Gallows Key"
    destination "San Aurelio"
    reward 810
    speaker offer "Brother Mateo"
    speaker visit "Brother Mateo"
    speaker complete "Brother Mateo"
    to offer
        has "The Observatory's Blue Flame: done"
    on offer
        conversation
            `Find Brother Mateo, who has been hiding a forbidden chart from a royal collector.`
            `Brother Mateo studies you for a moment. "The old sea charter settled one war, but it did not settle the past. The lost expedition sailed west under a sealed order, and its wake is stirring every ambitious captain in these waters."`
            choice
                `(I will help uncover what happened.)`
                    accept
                `(Tell me what you are not saying.)`
                    goto details
                `(I have no wish to be drawn into another quarrel.)`
                    close
            label details
                `Brother Mateo lowers their voice. "The maps were altered, the convoy erased from the books, and someone has been buying witnesses. Follow the evidence, not the flags."`
                choice
                    `(Then I will take the matter in hand.)`
                        accept
                    `(Not today.)`
                        close
    on accept
        log "Accepted The Monk Who Burned His Maps. Find Brother Mateo, who has been hiding a forbidden chart from a royal collector."
    on visit
        conversation
            `Brother Mateo receives you at San Aurelio. The evidence fits another piece into the puzzle: the expedition was not searching for gold alone, but for a place deliberately removed from every official chart.`
    on complete
        conversation
            `Brother Mateo thanks you. "Every answer makes the sea less simple, captain. Yet the truth belongs to the people who live here, not to the first crown or company that can put a seal upon it."`
        log "Completed The Monk Who Burned His Maps. Received 810 gold. Find Brother Mateo, who has been hiding a forbidden chart from a royal collector."
